   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Binc Stereo — QC at quarter proxy\n\nWhole take, one pass: `frames/` (241 × 16-bit PNG) → **LOAD proxy quarter** (960×540) → DA2 (`max_side 518`) → temporal filter → stereo → eye L / eye R PNG sequences in `output/binc-stereo-qc-quarter/L/` and `/R/`.\n\n- Memory: 241 × 960×540 ≈ 1.5 GB per tensor — fits comfortably; no windows needed, depth normalised once for the shot.\n- Progress: the top-bar % counts finished *nodes*; each Binc node shows its own bar on the node.\n- Every node's `info` / `report` prints seconds, s/frame and RSS / MPS memory — read those to size the full-res run.\n- Parallax is in % of width, so convergence / budgets / hull settings carry unchanged to `proxy full`.\n- Check `parallax_vis`: near = **dark**; else flip `depth_polarity`. `report.summary.ok` must be true."
   ],
   "title": "READ FIRST"
  },
